          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 13 2025 18:21:48 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Designed for the </span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">relief patients have been waiting for</span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">If your patient is experiencing low back pain caused by a herniated disc, disc decompression may be a treatment option.</span><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><sup></sup></span></p>\n",
