          "hideComponent": "false",
          "topMargin": "0",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 13 2025 18:21:48 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">How it works</span></span></span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Disc decompression is typically performed on an outpatient basis with local anesthesia. This may help alleviate the possible complications of general anesthesia with open surgery.<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup>&nbsp;For patients who want a minimally invasive alternative to surgery, this procedure may be an option for your patient.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 02 2026 14:38:42 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "backgroundColor": "rgb(255,255,255)",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
      "col2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "sling:resourceType": "wcm/foundation/components/parsys",
        "text_copy": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
          "bottomPadding": "3",
          "jcr:createdBy": "user-4a9aa678a2@example.invalid",
          "leftPadding": "3",
          "topPadding": "3",
          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-4a9aa678a2@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "topMargin": "0",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Mar 04 2025 21:46:00 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\">Benefits of the procedure</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Significant pain relief<sup><a href=\"#references\">2,3</a></sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Reduced use of pain medication<sup><a href=\"#references\">2,3</a></sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Improved function for normal daily activities<sup><a href=\"#references\">2,3</a></sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Defined amount of disc material removed<sup><a href=\"#references\">2,3</a></sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Quick recovery: 3-5 days, generally<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Low complication and morbidity rates<sup><a href=\"#references\">4</a></sup></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Performed with local anesthesia as an outpatient procedure.&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Studies have shown a low rate of complications with percutaneous discectomy versus open surgery<sup><a href=\"#references\">1</a></sup></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1em\">Please see&nbsp;<a href=\"https://labeling.stryker.com/hcp/XHR/US/pthxr?keycode=04546540466259\">Instructions for Use (IFU)</a>&nbsp;for a complete listing of warnings, precautions and adverse events.</span><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 02 2026 14:39:03 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "rightPadding": "3",
          "showDimensionalBox": "true",
          "textIsRich": "true",
          "leftMargin": "0"
        }
      }
    },
